./xmodel/sol-software2.md:33:The 12 banked points are D21 points with 22 coordinates, not D23 points. Their required regression result is **`NOT_IN_DOMAIN` / Row_22 compatibility failure for all 12**. If the pipeline assigns any of them an `e`, it has certified the wrong object. They are strong negative controls but provide no positive test of the valuation arithmetic.
