+ \mathcal E_{\rm MR}
+ =\frac12+\frac12=1,
+ \qquad
+ \operatorname{td}=2\cdot3\cdot1=6,
+ \qquad
+ \deg\Psi=6\cdot6=36.                              \tag{1.9}
+\]
